sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Client
    participant MediaCtrl as Media Controller
    participant Storage as Storage Service
    participant S3 as MinIO/S3
    participant MediaRepo as Media Repository
    participant PG as Postgres

    User->>Client: Upload media
    Client->>MediaCtrl: POST /media (multipart)
    MediaCtrl->>Storage: putObject(stream, path)
    Storage->>S3: PUT /bucket/path
    S3-->>Storage: 200 OK
    Storage-->>MediaCtrl: objectUri

    MediaCtrl->>MediaRepo: save metadata(uri, size, type)
    MediaRepo->>PG: INSERT media
    MediaCtrl-->>Client: 201 { id, uri }
